msgid ""
"Without pooling, the smaller heap barely mattered — 127K down to 108K, 4 Full GCs, 9 seconds total GC pause. Pooling collapsed: 144K down to 71K, *461 Full GCs*, and *30.6 seconds of GC pauses* in a 60-second run — the garbage collector was running half the time. *And it couldn't even recover the heap*: after each Full GC, pooling still had 640-710 MB live on a 910 MB old gen.\n"
